  {
    "chunkId": "FileSystemMCP-design:2026-08-20:002:f7edd5fa3f1b",
    "content": "# fs mcp\n\n@lmliheng/filesystem-mcp 定位为面向 AI 客户端的本地文件系统 MCP 服务，当前已完成基础闭环：基于允许目录白名单做路径校验与软链防护，提供读、写、编辑（diff 预览）、目录树、glob 搜索、元数据查询等工具",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "FileSystemMCP-design.md",
      "title": "fs mcp",
      "category": "agent mcp",
      "owner": "liheng",
      "sourceVersion": "2026-08-20",
      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentHash": "f7edd5fa3f1b",
      "chunkLength": 130
    }
  },
  {
    "chunkId": "FileSystemMCP-design:2026-08-20:003:a60b82902e8e",
    "content": "护，提供读、写、编辑（diff 预览）、目录树、glob 搜索、元数据查询等工具\n\n，stdio 通信、零外部依赖，可接入 Claude/Cursor/Copilot 等客户端，属于\"能跑、能用\"的社区级参考实现。",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "FileSystemMCP-design.md",
      "title": "fs mcp",
      "category": "agent mcp",
      "owner": "liheng",
      "sourceVersion": "2026-08-20",
      "chunkIndex": 3,
      "contentHash": "a60b82902e8e",
      "chunkLength": 107
    }
  },
  {
    "chunkId": "FileSystemMCP-design:2026-08-20:004:9e5147ea4b28",
    "content": "e/Cursor/Copilot 等客户端，属于\"能跑、能用\"的社区级参考实现。\n\n进展评价：核心安全模型（目录边界+realpath 解析）对齐官方思路，工具集覆盖日常coding场景，但相较成熟方案仍缺三块——批量多路径操作与逐条状态回报、只读/读写分级权限、大文件流式与 .gitignore 感知，测试与版本节奏也偏",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "FileSystemMCP-design.md",
      "title": "fs mcp",
      "category": "agent mcp",
      "owner": "liheng",
      "sourceVersion": "2026-08-20",
      "chunkIndex": 4,
      "contentHash": "9e5147ea4b28",
      "chunkLength": 162
    }
  },
  {
    "chunkId": "FileSystemMCP-design:2026-08-20:005:8f178b6eeed7",
    "content": "只读/读写分级权限、大文件流式与 .gitignore 感知，测试与版本节奏也偏\n\n早期。",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "FileSystemMCP-design.md",
      "title": "fs mcp",
      "category": "agent mcp",
      "owner": "liheng",
      "sourceVersion": "2026-08-20",
      "chunkIndex": 5,
      "contentHash": "8f178b6eeed7",
      "chunkLength": 45
    }
  },
  {
    "chunkId": "FileSystemMCP-design:2026-08-20:006:3eb2d57868b2",
    "content": "分级权限、大文件流式与 .gitignore 感知，测试与版本节奏也偏\n\n早期。\n\n后续更新思路：短期补 Zod 参数校验、批量 tool、edit 返回 unified diff、单元测试与 smoke 测试；中期加 --readonly 模式、MCP Roots 动态根、POSIX chmod/chown、正则多文件替",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "FileSystemMCP-design.md",
      "title": "fs mcp",
      "category": "agent mcp",
      "owner": "liheng",
      "sourceVersion": "2026-08-20",
      "chunkIndex": 6,
      "contentHash": "3eb2d57868b2",
      "chunkLength": 162
    }
  },
  {
    "chunkId": "FileSystemMCP-design:2026-08-20:007:06f9bdccad30",
    "content": "式、MCP Roots 动态根、POSIX chmod/chown、正则多文件替\n\n换、尊重 gitignore；长期可做 SSE/HTTP 传输、Docker 只读挂载示例、操作审计日志、WebDAV/对象存储适配。差异化建议是走\"安全可审计的轻量层\"而非堆功能，配套中文 README 与 Claude/Cursor 配",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "FileSystemMCP-design.md",
